cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use aibomstd in your research
or tooling, please cite it using this file."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Vasudevan
    given-names: Sriram
title: "aibomstd: AI Bill of Materials Standard"
abstract: "A vendor-neutral open standard, SDK,
and CLI for AI component transparency. Covers
models, datasets, frameworks, and API clients
with novel fields including api-client component
type, data-leaves-boundary flag, and EU AI Act
compliance gap mapping. Offline and CI-native."
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-01-15
url: "https://aibomstd.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aibomstd/spec"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - ai-bom
  - ai-bill-of-materials
  - ai-governance
  - eu-ai-act
  - supply-chain-security
  - cyclonedx
  - open-standard
  - machine-learning
  - mlsecops
